WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.280
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:14.550 --> 00:15.740
Yamao.

3
00:19.140 --> 00:20.220
Yamao.

4
00:26.110 --> 00:26.870
Forgive me.

5
00:33.990 --> 00:34.620
What?

6
00:34.620 --> 00:35.250
Youyou!

7
00:37.430 --> 00:37.940
Youyou.

8
00:39.750 --> 00:40.860
What happened last night?

9
00:40.990 --> 00:42.330
Why did we suddenly pass out?

10
00:42.560 --> 00:43.170
Last night,

11
00:43.170 --> 00:44.370
a thick fog rolled in.

12
00:44.520 --> 00:45.050
And then we

13
00:45.070 --> 00:45.940
blacked out.

14
00:50.070 --> 00:51.500
Good thing Yuwen Hao passed out too.

15
00:51.750 --> 00:52.580
Otherwise, you'd be

16
00:52.630 --> 00:53.410
burying me right now.

17
00:54.960 --> 00:56.290
Those immortal jerks are always trying

18
00:56.310 --> 00:57.410
to wipe us out.

19
00:57.990 --> 00:59.220
Now I've finally got one at my mercy.

20
00:59.600 --> 01:00.610
I'll make sure he never wakes up.

21
01:02.990 --> 01:04.370
You're still showing him mercy?

22
01:04.470 --> 01:05.220
Once he wakes up,

23
01:05.270 --> 01:06.590
you're as good as dead.

24
01:06.640 --> 01:08.000
If Master finds out what I did,

25
01:08.270 --> 01:09.310
he'll be furious.

26
01:11.720 --> 01:12.380
Besides, he did

27
01:12.380 --> 01:13.450
save both our lives once.

28
01:16.390 --> 01:17.450
I know how to deal with him.

29
02:44.780 --> 02:50.660
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

30
02:52.700 --> 02:58.660
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

31
02:59.700 --> 03:03.940
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

32
03:07.620 --> 03:15.180
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

33
03:15.540 --> 03:22.300
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

34
03:23.540 --> 03:30.180
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

35
03:31.380 --> 03:38.220
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

36
03:39.820 --> 03:46.340
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

37
03:51.100 --> 03:52.900
[Blossom in Darkness]

38
03:52.900 --> 03:54.900
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

39
03:54.900 --> 03:57.900
[Episode 6]

40
04:24.710 --> 04:25.420
It's her.

41
04:33.120 --> 04:34.370
What exactly did you just do?

42
04:34.560 --> 04:35.420
At Mount Zhaowu,

43
04:35.470 --> 04:36.450
they follow the Path of Detachment.

44
04:37.030 --> 04:37.620
That spiritual mark

45
04:37.910 --> 04:39.300
is the symbol of their cultivation.

46
04:40.080 --> 04:42.210
It's like the immortal core of other sect disciples.

47
04:42.680 --> 04:43.770
Once they lose it,

48
04:44.160 --> 04:46.120
it's like losing their virtue.

49
04:46.170 --> 04:47.130
Their faith in the immortal path is shattered.

50
04:47.750 --> 04:49.100
They can't even use magic anymore.

51
04:49.470 --> 04:51.500
So when he wakes up

52
04:51.960 --> 04:52.940
and thinks you've

53
04:53.000 --> 04:54.560
stolen his virtue,

54
04:54.810 --> 04:56.340
he'll be beside himself with shame!

55
04:57.000 --> 04:57.450
Give it back to me.

56
05:02.270 --> 05:02.770
Come and get it.

57
05:05.790 --> 05:06.180
You...

58
05:07.760 --> 05:08.130
I...

59
05:10.440 --> 05:10.860
You...

60
05:13.520 --> 05:14.980
How could you be so shameless?

61
05:15.470 --> 05:16.540
You're calling me shameless?

62
05:17.910 --> 05:19.300
Then why don't you ask yourself

63
05:19.320 --> 05:20.320
what was going through your mind

64
05:20.320 --> 05:21.220
while you were unconscious?

65
05:21.830 --> 05:23.470
If you hadn't let your heart stray,

66
05:24.030 --> 05:25.120
how could I have so easily

67
05:25.120 --> 05:25.940
taken your spiritual mark?

68
05:26.120 --> 05:27.460
I'm not like you heartless

69
05:27.460 --> 05:28.690
Mount Zhaowu disciples.

70
05:29.080 --> 05:30.540
I won't kill you while you're unconscious.

71
05:30.760 --> 05:31.540
I merely

72
05:31.560 --> 05:33.010
took this little thing to keep you in check,

73
05:33.350 --> 05:34.450
so you'd lose your powers

74
05:34.520 --> 05:35.570
and couldn't kill me.

75
05:36.960 --> 05:37.860
As for this mark,

76
05:37.860 --> 05:39.180
my life depends on it now.

77
05:39.710 --> 05:41.180
So I'll hold on to it for you.

78
05:41.710 --> 05:42.010
You...

79
05:42.860 --> 05:43.300
You can't leave.

80
05:44.350 --> 05:45.060
You... You...

81
05:45.760 --> 05:46.770
He's powerless now!

82
05:46.880 --> 05:48.090
I'll... I'll bite him to death!

83
05:50.030 --> 05:50.440
Let go!

84
06:12.560 --> 06:13.050
Honey.

85
06:13.390 --> 06:14.460
Something's happened at the village entrance.

86
06:14.600 --> 06:16.220
They say the rabbit demon's been caught.

87
06:16.750 --> 06:17.370
Rabbit demon?

88
06:17.800 --> 06:18.930
Honey, have you forgotten?

89
06:19.390 --> 06:20.580
There was a rabbit demon

90
06:20.720 --> 06:21.540
that took human form

91
06:21.560 --> 06:22.980
and snuck into our village to cause trouble.

92
06:23.160 --> 06:23.730
Ever since then,

93
06:23.950 --> 06:25.540
strangers have been banned from entering.

94
06:25.830 --> 06:26.610
From the looks of it,

95
06:27.310 --> 06:28.490
they must've caught the rabbit demon.

96
06:33.040 --> 06:33.540
Honey!

97
06:33.950 --> 06:42.340
- Beat him to death! - Kill him!

98
06:42.510 --> 06:43.340
Wait! Hold on!

99
06:43.390 --> 06:44.100
Please, hear me out!

100
06:44.430 --> 06:45.730
There's been a misunderstanding.

101
06:45.830 --> 06:46.810
We're really not

102
06:46.870 --> 06:48.170
the rabbit demon you're looking for.

103
06:48.270 --> 06:48.730
You two

104
06:48.870 --> 06:49.930
have been lurking outside the village

105
06:50.120 --> 06:50.730
and snooping around.

106
06:51.000 --> 06:51.900
You must be rabbit demons in disguise!

107
06:52.160 --> 06:53.510
You're trying to sneak in and eat us, aren't you?

108
06:53.510 --> 06:54.290
- That's right! - Exactly!

109
06:54.290 --> 06:54.850
Everyone,

110
06:55.510 --> 06:56.250
there must be

111
06:56.390 --> 06:57.250
some misunderstanding.

112
06:57.750 --> 06:58.650
We're just passing through.

113
06:58.750 --> 06:59.460
You're lying!

114
06:59.920 --> 07:00.290
This road

115
07:00.360 --> 07:01.580
doesn't lead anywhere!

116
07:01.680 --> 07:02.370
How could you be passing through?

117
07:02.510 --> 07:02.820
Exactly!

118
07:02.820 --> 07:03.540
Rabbit demons are cunning!

119
07:03.830 --> 07:05.140
Stop wasting your breath, everyone!

120
07:05.430 --> 07:06.020
Kill them!

121
07:06.160 --> 07:14.540
- Kill them! - Kill them!

122
07:14.630 --> 07:15.140
Yamao.

123
07:15.170 --> 07:15.900
Kill them!

124
07:16.600 --> 07:17.290
Qi Fengyin?

125
07:17.680 --> 07:18.170
Honey.

126
07:18.360 --> 07:19.490
Do you know these two?

127
07:19.720 --> 07:20.490
Honey?

128
07:34.590 --> 07:35.460
He...

129
07:36.070 --> 07:36.460
When...

130
07:36.490 --> 07:37.810
When did he get married?

131
07:38.430 --> 07:39.340
I was about to ask you.

132
07:40.190 --> 07:40.980
What's going on?

133
07:41.630 --> 07:42.410
How should I know?

134
07:42.560 --> 07:43.540
You're her husband now,

135
07:43.560 --> 07:44.170
and you don't know?

136
07:44.800 --> 07:45.250
Cheng Kong.

137
07:45.800 --> 07:46.980
Strangers aren't allowed near the village.

138
07:47.160 --> 07:47.730
How could you just

139
07:47.750 --> 07:48.490
untie them without permission?

140
07:48.560 --> 07:49.280
- Exactly! - That's right!

141
07:49.280 --> 07:49.980
Everyone,

142
07:50.360 --> 07:51.040
these two

143
07:51.040 --> 07:52.800
seem to know my husband.

144
07:52.830 --> 07:53.540
They're not rabbit demons.

145
07:53.920 --> 07:54.700
It's all a misunderstanding.

146
07:56.190 --> 07:56.540
Well...

147
08:03.950 --> 08:05.980
You must be my cousin's wife.

148
08:06.240 --> 08:07.020
I'm Yamao,

149
08:07.390 --> 08:08.370
his...

150
08:09.000 --> 08:10.140
distant cousin.

151
08:10.680 --> 08:11.290
What cousin?

152
08:13.270 --> 08:14.220
How come my husband

153
08:14.220 --> 08:15.050
never mentioned you?

154
08:15.920 --> 08:18.490
We haven't been in touch for ages.

155
08:19.120 --> 08:19.810
But then I heard

156
08:19.810 --> 08:21.140
he'd settled down and gotten married here.

157
08:24.630 --> 08:25.980
So my husband and I

158
08:26.430 --> 08:27.980
thought we'd pay you a visit.

159
08:30.720 --> 08:31.370
Unless you want

160
08:31.390 --> 08:32.340
to be burned as a rabbit demon,

161
08:32.510 --> 08:33.250
keep your mouth shut.

162
08:33.360 --> 08:33.700
And don't forget,

163
08:33.790 --> 08:34.700
I still have your spiritual mark.

164
08:44.360 --> 08:44.980
Greetings, cousin.

165
08:45.910 --> 08:46.490
Greetings, sis.

166
08:55.000 --> 08:56.580
So you're Mr. Cheng

167
08:56.790 --> 08:57.910
and Xiangyuan's family.

168
08:58.000 --> 08:58.490
What a misunderstanding!

169
08:58.790 --> 08:59.530
A terrible misunderstanding!

170
09:00.790 --> 09:02.060
Mr. Cheng?

171
09:06.360 --> 09:07.820
Come on in! Please, come inside!

172
09:15.150 --> 09:16.610
We haven't used this spare room in ages.

173
09:16.910 --> 09:18.650
You and your husband can stay here.

174
09:18.870 --> 09:20.180
But since this was so last-minute,

175
09:20.390 --> 09:21.220
I'm afraid you'll have to

176
09:21.240 --> 09:22.130
tidy it up yourselves.

177
09:23.510 --> 09:24.820
I'm expecting a baby,

178
09:25.240 --> 09:26.180
so it's a little difficult for me.

179
09:29.670 --> 09:30.530
What are you looking at me for?

180
09:32.150 --> 09:34.100
This is all because you didn't tell me

181
09:34.150 --> 09:35.370
they were coming.

182
09:37.600 --> 09:38.100
Alright.

183
09:38.270 --> 09:39.530
I'll go get some bedding.

184
09:39.750 --> 09:41.250
Honey, take good care of our guests.

185
09:49.600 --> 09:50.300
Qi Fengyin.

186
09:50.840 --> 09:52.940
Why are you terrorizing innocent villagers?

187
09:55.240 --> 09:56.820
Last time, I told you your skills were lacking

188
09:57.120 --> 09:58.490
and told you to go home and practice.

189
09:59.360 --> 10:00.060
Did you?

190
10:00.390 --> 10:01.610
Why don't you find out?

191
10:08.750 --> 10:09.370
Go on, fight.

192
10:10.000 --> 10:10.580
Come on, fight.

193
10:13.840 --> 10:14.530
What are you looking at me for?

194
10:15.480 --> 10:16.890
Your spiritual mark and mystical flower?

195
10:17.320 --> 10:17.940
You can both forget about getting them back.

196
10:18.790 --> 10:19.940
One of you lost his spiritual mark,

197
10:20.440 --> 10:22.060
and the other's powers are sealed by the Wanjun Lock.

198
10:22.720 --> 10:23.580
From now on,

199
10:24.150 --> 10:25.060
I'm in charge here!

200
10:36.360 --> 10:37.340
Aren't you going to explain

201
10:37.360 --> 10:38.580
why she's calling you her husband?

202
10:39.200 --> 10:41.010
Since when did you get married

203
10:41.270 --> 10:42.650
and get your wife pregnant?

204
10:43.390 --> 10:44.530
If I'd shown up any later,

205
10:44.870 --> 10:46.130
would I be congratulating you on becoming a father?

206
10:46.130 --> 10:46.700
Calm down!

207
10:46.750 --> 10:47.740
His Lordship probably

208
10:47.740 --> 10:48.580
has no idea what's going on either.

209
10:48.630 --> 10:50.130
My Lord, please explain!

210
10:50.270 --> 10:51.010
Honey is

211
10:51.010 --> 10:52.420
what a married woman

212
10:52.510 --> 10:53.940
calls the man she loves.

213
10:54.600 --> 10:56.180
You didn't let her take advantage of you, did you?

214
10:56.320 --> 10:57.490
He's got a mind of his own.

215
10:58.160 --> 10:59.820
How could anyone take advantage of him so easily?

216
11:00.440 --> 11:01.530
Who's taking advantage of whom

217
11:01.600 --> 11:02.530
remains to be seen.

218
11:05.550 --> 11:07.130
I woke up and someone brought me here.

219
11:07.790 --> 11:09.650
She seems to have mistaken me for someone else.

220
11:10.120 --> 11:11.060
She keeps calling me her husband.

221
11:11.390 --> 11:13.370
What do you have in common

222
11:13.870 --> 11:15.460
with this Cheng Kong they keep mentioning?

223
11:15.960 --> 11:17.370
Why do Xiangyuan and the villagers

224
11:17.670 --> 11:18.610
all mistake you for him?

225
11:19.840 --> 11:20.420
And another thing.

226
11:21.030 --> 11:22.130
Knowing you,

227
11:22.910 --> 11:24.420
how could you let anyone push you around?

228
11:24.670 --> 11:25.890
The Wanjun Lock has sealed his powers.

229
11:26.600 --> 11:27.460
Without powers,

230
11:28.080 --> 11:29.580
he had no choice but to hide deep in the mountains

231
11:29.960 --> 11:30.890
to escape the immortal sects.

232
11:31.270 --> 11:31.940
Coming from someone who nearly

233
11:31.960 --> 11:33.250
died on Mount Leiguan,

234
11:34.000 --> 11:35.220
that's rich.

235
11:40.550 --> 11:41.730
I sense a wisp of my malice here.

236
11:42.840 --> 11:43.580
See? I told you!

237
11:43.790 --> 11:44.530
My compass

238
11:44.550 --> 11:45.370
really does come in handy!

239
11:45.840 --> 11:46.420
Your malice?

240
11:46.630 --> 11:47.130
Where is it?

241
11:47.600 --> 11:48.370
Hurry up and find it!

242
11:48.390 --> 11:49.100
Water your mystical flower with it,

243
11:49.320 --> 11:50.420
then give me back my master's soul crystal.

244
11:50.550 --> 11:51.980
This whole place is shrouded in demonic aura.

245
11:52.480 --> 11:53.060
I can't find it.

246
11:53.670 --> 11:54.370
Yamao,

247
11:55.440 --> 11:56.530
you're helping him find his malice?

248
11:56.580 --> 11:56.960
I...

249
11:58.120 --> 11:59.180
You've gone too far!

250
12:00.150 --> 12:00.760
Don't you realize

251
12:00.760 --> 12:02.080
you're helping him become the Devil Incarnate?

252
12:03.150 --> 12:04.000
Give me back my spiritual mark.

253
12:04.360 --> 12:05.010
What spiritual mark?

254
12:06.360 --> 12:07.460
Well, to put it simply,

255
12:07.460 --> 12:07.980
this

256
12:08.000 --> 12:09.300
immortal jerk from Mount Zhaowu

257
12:09.600 --> 12:10.400
wants to take

258
12:10.400 --> 12:11.840
the Moonlit Revival Herb's herb core

259
12:11.910 --> 12:12.700
and give it to his master.

260
12:13.150 --> 12:14.050
And this little herb,

261
12:14.050 --> 12:15.090
to save her own life,

262
12:15.240 --> 12:16.610
stole his virtue.

263
12:16.790 --> 12:18.530
Now he wants his spiritual mark back

264
12:18.720 --> 12:19.460
so he can regain his powers,

265
12:19.550 --> 12:20.940
kill you first,

266
12:21.030 --> 12:21.770
then kill her,

267
12:21.870 --> 12:23.340
and finally come after me.

268
12:24.200 --> 12:25.010
You want to kill her?

269
12:25.510 --> 12:26.340
What's it to you?

270
12:31.360 --> 12:31.940
Enough!

271
12:33.360 --> 12:34.220
Look at you two,

272
12:34.240 --> 12:35.300
squabbling like a couple of helpless chicks.

273
12:36.080 --> 12:36.850
What's the point of fighting?

274
12:37.000 --> 12:37.890
You can barely protect yourselves.

275
12:38.200 --> 12:39.490
Maybe that mighty demon should come to the village

276
12:39.790 --> 12:40.820
and swallow you both whole!

277
12:41.120 --> 12:42.220
Then you can fight inside its belly

278
12:42.240 --> 12:42.890
to your hearts' content!

279
12:43.030 --> 12:43.850
- Nonsense. - Absurd.

280
12:46.390 --> 12:47.130
If you want to fight,

281
12:47.390 --> 12:48.420
you can do it anytime.

282
12:49.360 --> 12:50.130
Qi Fengyin,

283
12:50.150 --> 12:51.580
if you're going to find your malice here,

284
12:52.320 --> 12:54.610
you need to put your grudges aside for now.

285
12:57.200 --> 12:57.650
And you!

286
12:58.360 --> 12:59.700
As a disciple of Mount Zhaowu,

287
12:59.840 --> 13:00.700
isn't it your duty to vanquish devils...

288
13:02.720 --> 13:03.220
demons...

289
13:05.960 --> 13:07.530
I mean, monsters,

290
13:07.840 --> 13:09.220
and protect innocent people?

291
13:09.510 --> 13:10.460
Something's clearly wrong with this place.

292
13:10.630 --> 13:11.850
Don't you want to find out what's going on?

293
13:13.960 --> 13:14.440
This village

294
13:14.440 --> 13:16.010
shuns outsiders because of rumors about a rabbit demon.

295
13:16.390 --> 13:16.940
For now,

296
13:17.080 --> 13:17.940
we need to keep

297
13:17.960 --> 13:18.690
our true identities hidden

298
13:18.790 --> 13:20.610
if we want to stay here

299
13:20.910 --> 13:22.460
and accomplish what we each came for.

300
13:22.670 --> 13:24.370
That means putting aside our differences

301
13:24.870 --> 13:25.420
and working together.

302
13:25.440 --> 13:26.300
Impossible.

303
13:28.870 --> 13:29.940
See? You two already agree on something.

304
13:39.670 --> 13:40.610
What's going on?

305
13:41.390 --> 13:43.220
Am I interrupting your reunion?

306
13:46.550 --> 13:47.300
No, not at all.

307
13:48.600 --> 13:49.580
Let me help you, Xiangyuan.

308
13:50.840 --> 13:52.340
We only have one quilt left.

309
13:52.550 --> 13:53.530
I'm afraid

310
13:53.720 --> 13:55.100
you and your husband will have to share it tonight.

311
13:57.720 --> 13:58.580
Alright, honey.

312
13:58.870 --> 13:59.770
Let's let them rest.

313
14:00.510 --> 14:01.330
You've traveled such a long way.

314
14:01.330 --> 14:02.220
You must be exhausted.

315
14:02.720 --> 14:03.770
We shouldn't disturb you.

316
14:04.550 --> 14:06.420
You two are sharing a room tonight?

317
14:11.320 --> 14:12.890
Honey, what are you talking about?

318
14:13.030 --> 14:15.060
They're husband and wife.

319
14:15.120 --> 14:16.340
Of course they'll share a room.

320
14:17.030 --> 14:17.730
I won't allow it.

321
14:25.720 --> 14:26.130
Cheng Kong!

322
14:26.150 --> 14:27.370
What have I done to upset you?

323
14:28.270 --> 14:29.700
You won't even talk to me!

324
14:30.270 --> 14:31.250
I'm pregnant,

325
14:31.270 --> 14:32.060
and I carried all that bedding here!

326
14:32.080 --> 14:33.420
You didn't even offer to help!

327
14:33.790 --> 14:35.650
Do you even care about me as your wife?

328
14:36.510 --> 14:37.940
You never used to treat me this way.

329
14:38.240 --> 14:39.300
Before every trip,

330
14:40.200 --> 14:41.890
you'd promise to bring me morning glories.

331
14:42.750 --> 14:44.490
But this time, you completely forgot.

332
14:44.510 --> 14:44.850
I...

333
14:45.790 --> 14:47.350
I barely recognize you anymore.

334
14:48.150 --> 14:49.250
Sometimes I even feel

335
14:49.250 --> 14:50.500
like you're not my husband!

336
14:52.080 --> 14:53.340
Of course he is, Xiangyuan!

337
14:53.630 --> 14:54.850
He's your husband!

338
14:55.600 --> 14:57.850
You see, my cousin

339
14:57.910 --> 14:58.900
hurt his head on this last trip.

340
14:58.900 --> 15:00.580
That's why he's been acting so strangely.

341
15:06.390 --> 15:08.090
I had no idea he'd hurt his head.

342
15:09.080 --> 15:09.820
Are you alright?

343
15:10.510 --> 15:11.180
He's fine! He's fine!

344
15:11.360 --> 15:12.850
Just a minor injury. He'll recover soon.

345
15:14.270 --> 15:15.340
I'm sorry, you two. I...

346
15:16.480 --> 15:17.810
I must have frightened you just now.

347
15:17.810 --> 15:18.150
I...

348
15:18.870 --> 15:20.260
Please, make yourselves comfortable.

349
15:20.260 --> 15:20.690
I'll...

350
15:21.360 --> 15:22.880
I'll go prepare dinner for you.

351
15:29.140 --> 15:29.700
See what you've done?

352
15:30.270 --> 15:31.250
All that arguing!

353
15:31.630 --> 15:33.130
If Xiangyuan gets suspicious,

354
15:33.440 --> 15:34.610
we'll all be mistaken for rabbit demons

355
15:34.720 --> 15:35.730
and end up in serious trouble!

356
15:40.240 --> 15:40.770
Hao,

357
15:41.600 --> 15:42.890
stay here and clean the room with Youyou.

358
15:43.030 --> 15:43.580
Qi Fengyin!

359
15:44.440 --> 15:44.980
Come outside with me.

360
15:53.300 --> 15:54.010
Alright, let's hear it.

361
15:55.030 --> 15:55.890
Why did you bring me out here?

362
15:56.320 --> 15:57.460
Didn't Xiangyuan tell you?

363
15:57.790 --> 15:59.060
Her husband always brings her

364
15:59.060 --> 16:00.340
morning glories when he comes home.

365
16:00.870 --> 16:02.300
You've already upset her enough.

366
16:02.870 --> 16:03.820
Of course we're going to find some

367
16:03.840 --> 16:04.700
so you can make it up to her.

368
16:07.510 --> 16:08.180
You brought me out here

369
16:08.200 --> 16:09.250
just for that?

370
16:09.440 --> 16:10.420
Nothing else you want to ask?

371
16:12.120 --> 16:12.700
Of course.

372
16:12.960 --> 16:14.300
While we're at it,

373
16:15.000 --> 16:16.490
my master's soul crystal

374
16:16.840 --> 16:18.180
is still in one piece, right?

375
16:22.910 --> 16:24.420
He must mean a lot to you

376
16:24.960 --> 16:26.650
since you're always worrying about him.

377
16:27.120 --> 16:28.130
What kind of person

378
16:28.440 --> 16:29.300
was he when he was alive?

379
16:30.480 --> 16:31.220
What do you mean, "was alive"?

380
16:31.550 --> 16:32.610
My master's still alive!

381
16:35.910 --> 16:36.890
You wounded him so badly

382
16:37.320 --> 16:38.180
that he ended up like this.

383
16:38.360 --> 16:39.340
And now you're asking me

384
16:39.360 --> 16:40.220
what kind of person he is?

385
16:40.440 --> 16:41.890
He's the best person in the world!

386
16:43.000 --> 16:44.340
I've never even met your master.

387
16:44.390 --> 16:45.220
How could I have hurt him?

388
16:47.000 --> 16:48.300
You really don't remember a thing?

389
16:52.200 --> 16:52.730
That figures.

390
16:53.240 --> 16:54.980
When you unleashed that rain of fire,

391
16:55.320 --> 16:57.220
you were trying to destroy the Saintess's Shrine.

392
16:57.550 --> 16:58.220
As for everyone else,

393
16:58.360 --> 16:59.580
we weren't even worth your attention.

394
16:59.910 --> 17:00.890
So of course you had no idea

395
17:00.960 --> 17:01.980
that your devastating attack

396
17:02.150 --> 17:03.220
also caught my master and me

397
17:03.240 --> 17:04.460
in the middle of it.

398
17:04.790 --> 17:05.490
No wonder

399
17:05.790 --> 17:07.250
you can talk about it like it's nothing.

400
17:08.240 --> 17:09.810
I never unleashed any rain of fire.

401
17:10.750 --> 17:11.770
Why are you blaming me

402
17:12.400 --> 17:13.770
for something I didn't do?

403
17:15.160 --> 17:16.730
And this Saintess's Shrine you mentioned,

404
17:16.790 --> 17:18.140
why would I want to destroy it?

405
17:19.790 --> 17:20.620
The shrine

406
17:20.920 --> 17:22.090
belongs to the Saintess of the Tides.

407
17:22.640 --> 17:23.770
She sealed you away for a thousand years.

408
17:24.310 --> 17:25.090
Aren't you afraid of her?

409
17:26.030 --> 17:26.980
So she's the one

410
17:27.030 --> 17:28.050
who sealed me away.

411
17:29.790 --> 17:31.420
But I broke her seal with ease.

412
17:32.200 --> 17:34.250
She can't have been that powerful.

413
17:34.440 --> 17:35.940
You don't even remember

414
17:35.940 --> 17:36.660
the Saintess of the Tides?

415
17:40.680 --> 17:41.700
As far back as I can remember,

416
17:41.720 --> 17:43.180
I was sealed inside Mount Qihuang.

417
17:44.790 --> 17:46.460
I remember nothing before that.

418
17:47.680 --> 17:48.490
The only thing I do remember

419
17:48.550 --> 17:50.050
is someone connected to the mystical flower.

420
17:52.680 --> 17:53.530
So you're saying

421
17:54.510 --> 17:55.940
you really weren't behind that rain of fire?

422
17:57.480 --> 17:58.380
How is that possible?

423
17:59.240 --> 18:00.490
Who else could've done it?

424
18:00.750 --> 18:01.620
If you don't believe me,

425
18:02.200 --> 18:03.290
why bother asking?

426
18:03.550 --> 18:04.660
From now on,

427
18:05.160 --> 18:06.250
I won't answer any more of your questions.

428
18:08.200 --> 18:09.250
Why are you upset again?

429
18:13.920 --> 18:14.730
Then again,

430
18:15.270 --> 18:16.090
knowing how Qi Fengyin

431
18:16.110 --> 18:17.290
always means what he says,

432
18:17.790 --> 18:19.010
he wouldn't bother lying to me.

433
18:20.880 --> 18:22.490
But if he's telling the truth,

434
18:23.270 --> 18:25.770
who unleashed that rain of fire?

435
18:34.400 --> 18:34.900
Is that enough?

436
18:39.270 --> 18:40.050
If you give Xiangyuan

437
18:40.070 --> 18:41.380
that pile of dead vines,

438
18:41.590 --> 18:42.490
the three of us might as well

439
18:42.510 --> 18:43.770
pack our bags and leave the village.

440
18:50.310 --> 18:51.570
I really need to teach you

441
18:51.570 --> 18:52.530
how to act like a proper husband.

442
18:53.350 --> 18:54.940
Xiangyuan is pregnant.

443
18:55.440 --> 18:57.250
Since you're pretending to be her husband,

444
18:57.590 --> 18:58.570
you should be more considerate.

445
18:59.200 --> 19:01.290
People's feelings are fragile.

446
19:02.110 --> 19:04.570
Treat her like someone you truly love,

447
19:05.350 --> 19:06.460
the way you care for your mystical flower.

448
19:27.310 --> 19:28.900
The mystical flower isn't someone I love.

449
19:33.200 --> 19:34.810
Then why have you worked so hard

450
19:35.000 --> 19:35.980
to make it bloom?

451
19:36.070 --> 19:37.220
Don't ask what doesn't concern you.

452
19:41.830 --> 19:43.140
You've got plenty of secrets.

453
19:44.000 --> 19:45.250
Besides the mystical flower,

454
19:45.480 --> 19:47.010
is there anything else you hold dear?

455
19:51.830 --> 19:53.530
What does it mean to hold something dear?

456
19:54.070 --> 19:55.220
It means

457
19:56.070 --> 19:57.660
something you treasure most,

458
19:57.920 --> 19:58.730
or someone.

459
19:59.510 --> 20:00.460
You'd protect her

460
20:01.240 --> 20:02.860
and never let anyone hurt her.

461
20:05.240 --> 20:06.450
Well, by that definition,

462
20:06.450 --> 20:07.980
I'm protecting you right now,

463
20:08.750 --> 20:10.460
keeping Mount Zhaowu from hurting you.

464
20:11.270 --> 20:13.010
Does that make you someone I hold dear?

465
20:19.720 --> 20:21.570
I... Of course not!

466
20:22.960 --> 20:24.290
We're only working together

467
20:24.550 --> 20:25.530
because we both have something to gain.

468
20:30.000 --> 20:31.290
When you truly love someone,

469
20:32.720 --> 20:34.180
just thinking about her

470
20:34.640 --> 20:35.570
makes your heart feel

471
20:35.590 --> 20:36.570
like a feather is brushing against it,

472
20:36.790 --> 20:37.570
giving you butterflies.

473
20:38.290 --> 20:39.290
When you can't be with her,

474
20:39.480 --> 20:40.860
your heart aches so badly

475
20:41.200 --> 20:41.980
you can barely breathe.

476
20:43.160 --> 20:44.010
And when she's sad,

477
20:44.510 --> 20:45.900
you feel even worse than she does.

478
20:52.240 --> 20:53.420
I don't need you to teach me.

479
21:03.240 --> 21:03.940
If I weren't trying

480
21:03.960 --> 21:05.330
to help you recover your malice

481
21:05.480 --> 21:06.420
and get my master's soul crystal back...

482
21:06.790 --> 21:07.660
I wouldn't bother teaching you!

483
21:19.000 --> 21:20.050
That's so thoughtful of you, honey.

484
21:20.410 --> 21:21.940
You even got all these for me.

485
21:25.590 --> 21:26.290
It was nothing.

486
21:29.960 --> 21:31.380
Why aren't you eating?

487
21:31.830 --> 21:33.620
We live deep in the mountains.

488
21:33.790 --> 21:34.660
I'm sorry the food is so simple.

489
21:34.880 --> 21:35.700
I hope you don't mind.

490
21:36.310 --> 21:36.900
Not at all.

491
21:37.480 --> 21:39.090
Your cooking is delicious, Xiangyuan.

492
21:40.790 --> 21:41.860
It's all that rabbit demon's fault.

493
21:42.070 --> 21:43.980
It keeps sneaking in and eating our livestock.

494
21:44.350 --> 21:45.420
And we can never catch it.

495
21:45.790 --> 21:46.770
Now there's less and less

496
21:46.790 --> 21:47.730
food left in the village.

497
21:47.830 --> 21:48.980
If a demon is causing trouble,

498
21:49.880 --> 21:51.180
why not ask an immortal sect to get rid of it?

499
21:52.030 --> 21:53.090
We've thought about that.

500
21:53.830 --> 21:55.490
But we're so far from anywhere,

501
21:55.640 --> 21:57.460
and the mountain fog gets so thick at night

502
21:57.680 --> 21:58.730
that no one can find their way out.

503
22:08.960 --> 22:09.810
Yamao, what's wrong?

504
22:12.920 --> 22:13.660
I'm fine.

505
22:13.920 --> 22:14.850
Are you having trouble

506
22:14.850 --> 22:15.730
adjusting to the climate here?

507
22:15.880 --> 22:16.700
Thank you, Xiangyuan.

508
22:22.640 --> 22:23.620
I think

509
22:24.270 --> 22:26.140
an old injury hasn't fully healed.

510
22:26.510 --> 22:27.290
It's been giving me trouble.

511
22:27.830 --> 22:28.250
But it's nothing serious.

512
22:28.440 --> 22:29.290
Some medicine should help.

513
22:29.480 --> 22:30.050
Don't worry.

514
22:31.480 --> 22:32.940
Then get some rest after dinner.

515
22:33.550 --> 22:34.250
Come on, let's eat!

516
22:36.830 --> 22:37.250
Oh, one more thing.

517
22:38.160 --> 22:38.810
Once night falls,

518
22:38.960 --> 22:39.900
whatever you do, don't leave

519
22:39.960 --> 22:40.770
your room.

520
22:46.590 --> 22:47.900
I've already got

521
22:47.920 --> 22:48.530
your spiritual mark.

522
22:48.830 --> 22:50.250
Given where things stand between us,

523
22:50.680 --> 22:51.940
do you really need to avoid me like this?

524
22:52.440 --> 22:53.530
You took it by force.

525
22:54.030 --> 22:54.900
I never agreed to it.

526
23:03.110 --> 23:04.730
Aren't you curious

527
23:05.000 --> 23:06.570
what exactly I did to you

528
23:06.680 --> 23:07.570
to get your spiritual mark?

529
23:07.750 --> 23:08.330
What did you do?

530
23:08.680 --> 23:09.770
Oh, I couldn't possibly say.

531
23:10.240 --> 23:11.220
You'll have to figure it out yourself.

532
23:23.400 --> 23:24.290
Qi Fengyin?

533
23:25.270 --> 23:26.620
What are you doing here?

534
23:27.000 --> 23:28.660
Knowing someone wants to kill you,

535
23:29.480 --> 23:31.010
how could I leave you two alone?

536
23:34.790 --> 23:35.940
And what's it supposed to look like

537
23:36.000 --> 23:36.490
with two men and a woman alone

538
23:36.720 --> 23:37.490
in one room?

539
23:38.000 --> 23:38.570
Get out of here!

540
23:43.510 --> 23:44.010
Fine.

541
23:44.400 --> 23:45.050
There's no talking sense into you.

542
23:45.920 --> 23:47.140
Then you stay with him.

543
23:47.440 --> 23:48.180
I'll bunk with Xiangyuan.

544
23:54.200 --> 23:55.620
What did you just give her?

545
23:58.440 --> 23:59.380
Something from Mount Zhaowu.

546
24:00.400 --> 24:01.770
Of course you've never seen it before.

547
24:02.030 --> 24:02.900
Oh, I've seen enough.

548
24:04.200 --> 24:05.160
Nothing from Mount Zhaowu

549
24:05.160 --> 24:06.220
is ever any good.

550
24:07.720 --> 24:09.090
At best, it's just filthy.

551
24:14.920 --> 24:15.490
Don't forget,

552
24:15.680 --> 24:16.660
I've got what matters most

553
24:16.680 --> 24:17.730
to both of you.

554
24:18.160 --> 24:19.460
If either of you causes trouble,

555
24:20.880 --> 24:21.730
we're all going down together.

556
24:49.590 --> 24:50.660
Qi Fengyin's powers

557
24:50.680 --> 24:52.010
are sealed by the Wanjun Lock.

558
24:55.160 --> 24:56.330
Night has finally fallen.

559
24:57.070 --> 24:58.460
The moon is especially bright tonight.

560
24:59.110 --> 25:00.090
Just what I need.

561
26:05.270 --> 26:06.090
Well, look at you!

562
26:06.200 --> 26:07.900
I never thought someone from a respected sect

563
26:08.030 --> 26:08.980
would stoop so low

564
26:09.000 --> 26:09.900
as to sneak around like a thief.

565
26:10.000 --> 26:10.290
I...

566
26:10.550 --> 26:12.010
You've got some nerve accusing others.

567
26:12.750 --> 26:13.010
I...

568
26:15.110 --> 26:16.530
I'm the only one here who can use magic.

569
26:16.680 --> 26:17.330
So I'm calling the shots!

570
26:17.550 --> 26:18.810
Give me back my master's soul crystal!

571
26:19.160 --> 26:20.180
Trying to take it by force?

572
26:21.790 --> 26:22.860
Even with the Wanjun Lock,

573
26:23.240 --> 26:24.980
I can still crush your master's soul crystal.

574
26:25.590 --> 26:26.380
Go ahead. Try me.

575
26:27.680 --> 26:28.490
Yuwen Hao, hold him down.

576
26:28.550 --> 26:29.250
Give me back my spiritual mark first.

577
26:29.440 --> 26:29.620
I...

578
26:30.240 --> 26:30.420
You...

579
26:41.790 --> 26:42.380
Xiangyuan, we...

580
26:45.680 --> 26:46.290
Xiangyuan!

581
26:47.550 --> 26:48.660
Please, let me explain, Xiangyuan!

582
27:18.830 --> 27:19.420
Xiangyuan.

583
27:20.270 --> 27:21.050
Please don't cry.

584
27:21.960 --> 27:23.730
There's been a misunderstanding.

585
27:24.110 --> 27:25.530
Can I explain what happened?

586
27:27.590 --> 27:28.220
Xiangyuan.

587
27:41.480 --> 27:42.660
Can't you tell there's something wrong with her?

588
28:07.000 --> 28:08.010
What's wrong with Xiangyuan?

589
28:16.400 --> 28:17.180
Something's coming.

590
28:31.920 --> 28:33.180
It's the villagers from earlier today.

591
28:34.030 --> 28:34.940
They're clearly human.

592
28:35.550 --> 28:36.860
So why do they give off such a ghostly aura?

593
28:44.270 --> 28:44.940
You two,

594
28:45.830 --> 28:46.530
stay close to me.

595
29:41.030 --> 29:41.700
You're awake.

596
29:47.160 --> 29:48.420
Did I wake you?

597
29:59.240 --> 29:59.810
Xiangyuan.

598
30:01.070 --> 30:02.660
Did you sleep well last night?

599
30:03.720 --> 30:06.460
Did you get hungry

600
30:07.270 --> 30:08.730
and get up to find something to eat?

601
30:27.400 --> 30:28.340
Didn't we go to bed early

602
30:28.340 --> 30:29.620
last night?

603
30:30.070 --> 30:30.770
Besides,

604
30:31.110 --> 30:32.420
I'm pregnant.

605
30:32.720 --> 30:33.900
I can't just eat whatever I want.

606
30:34.680 --> 30:35.770
I think you're still half asleep

607
30:35.790 --> 30:36.770
and talking nonsense.

608
30:37.440 --> 30:39.530
Your husband and mine are already up.

609
30:39.830 --> 30:40.700
You should wash up

610
30:40.750 --> 30:41.570
and come have breakfast.

611
30:58.720 --> 30:59.290
Youyou!

612
31:00.160 --> 31:00.700
Youyou!

613
31:01.590 --> 31:02.570
Youyou!

614
31:03.440 --> 31:04.530
I'm coming.

615
31:05.640 --> 31:06.560
What do you want?

616
31:06.560 --> 31:08.170
Why wake me from my beauty sleep so early?

617
31:08.170 --> 31:08.570
Youyou.

618
31:08.920 --> 31:09.860
Do you remember what happened

619
31:09.860 --> 31:10.490
last night?

620
31:11.240 --> 31:12.490
Last night?

621
31:13.270 --> 31:14.730
I was so sleepy last night

622
31:15.240 --> 31:16.980
that I fell asleep as soon as I turned back into a doll.

623
31:17.590 --> 31:18.660
What happened?

624
31:19.270 --> 31:19.810
What?

625
31:20.510 --> 31:20.900
Eating...

626
31:22.200 --> 31:23.570
Eating a live chicken?

627
31:24.350 --> 31:25.420
Ghostly figures in the fog?

628
31:26.510 --> 31:27.700
I only

629
31:27.720 --> 31:28.980
went to bed a little early,

630
31:29.220 --> 31:30.760
and I missed all that excitement?

631
31:31.000 --> 31:31.570
What happened next?

632
31:31.640 --> 31:32.610
Come on, tell me.

633
31:32.640 --> 31:33.420
When I woke up,

634
31:34.270 --> 31:35.330
I was back in my room.

635
31:39.160 --> 31:40.090
So...

636
31:40.510 --> 31:41.530
Even you fell for it?

637
31:44.720 --> 31:45.380
Silly Yamao.

638
31:46.070 --> 31:47.050
Why bring that up?

639
31:47.160 --> 31:48.420
If that rabbit demon hadn't been

640
31:48.420 --> 31:49.290
lurking in the shadows,

641
31:49.440 --> 31:50.700
and His Lordship hadn't been so weak

642
31:50.790 --> 31:51.770
that it could take advantage of him,

643
31:51.880 --> 31:52.980
there's no way His Lordship would've...

644
31:53.270 --> 31:53.810
Shut up!

645
31:53.920 --> 31:54.250
Okay.

646
31:55.510 --> 31:56.860
If the rabbit demon can change its form,

647
31:57.160 --> 31:58.330
it could be hiding here.

648
31:59.400 --> 32:00.900
That wisp of malice must be nearby.

649
32:01.350 --> 32:02.290
I've already searched the village.

650
32:03.160 --> 32:04.330
Everyone here is an ordinary villager.

651
32:04.720 --> 32:05.810
None of them is a rabbit demon in disguise.

652
32:06.000 --> 32:06.530
Then again,

653
32:07.400 --> 32:08.730
I've lost my powers,

654
32:09.310 --> 32:10.330
so I might have missed something.

655
32:11.240 --> 32:12.050
If...

656
32:18.030 --> 32:18.660
Hao,

657
32:18.960 --> 32:19.770
do you think I'm stupid?

658
32:20.200 --> 32:21.180
If I give you back your spiritual mark,

659
32:21.350 --> 32:22.290
I'll be dead before

660
32:22.510 --> 32:23.620
we find the rabbit demon.

661
32:23.830 --> 32:24.530
Then what do you suggest?

662
32:25.480 --> 32:27.290
Maybe we could ask around

663
32:27.350 --> 32:28.050
the village

664
32:28.790 --> 32:30.140
and find out

665
32:30.160 --> 32:31.090
what happened here before,

666
32:32.070 --> 32:33.660
and when that rabbit demon first appeared.

667
32:34.000 --> 32:35.700
And Xiangyuan's husband, Cheng Kong...

668
32:36.160 --> 32:37.330
Who exactly is he?

669
32:38.070 --> 32:38.860
And another thing.

670
32:39.240 --> 32:40.460
Why does everyone

671
32:40.550 --> 32:41.770
keep mistaking His Lordship

672
32:41.790 --> 32:42.770
for Xiangyuan's husband?

673
32:43.640 --> 32:45.220
If they can mistake me for someone else,

674
32:45.920 --> 32:46.750
it means these people

675
32:46.750 --> 32:47.980
aren't fully conscious during the day.

676
32:49.400 --> 32:51.140
Once I overcome the Wanjun Lock again,

677
32:52.110 --> 32:53.490
I'll be able to purge this place

678
32:53.510 --> 32:54.380
of demonic aura.

679
32:55.160 --> 32:56.660
If I have to, I'll raze this village.

680
32:56.960 --> 32:58.660
That rabbit demon won't escape me.

681
32:58.750 --> 32:59.490
Absurd.

682
33:00.240 --> 33:01.570
Ordinary people live here.

683
33:02.270 --> 33:03.940
You can't just destroy their homes.

684
33:05.720 --> 33:06.560
Can we stop talking

685
33:06.560 --> 33:07.570
about destroying the village?

686
33:07.680 --> 33:08.700
We're nowhere near that point yet.

687
33:09.070 --> 33:10.700
If I can get to the bottom of this,

688
33:10.880 --> 33:11.940
why would we need your help?

689
33:12.200 --> 33:13.250
It's just a rabbit demon.

690
33:13.440 --> 33:14.260
It can only prey on

691
33:14.260 --> 33:15.330
defenseless mortals.

692
33:15.880 --> 33:16.700
When night falls,

693
33:17.160 --> 33:18.490
I'll kill it myself.

694
33:19.790 --> 33:20.380
Hao.

695
33:20.480 --> 33:20.860
Come on.

696
33:21.240 --> 33:22.490
Let's go see what we can find out.

697
33:29.110 --> 33:29.700
What's wrong?

698
33:31.640 --> 33:32.290
Nothing.

699
33:37.400 --> 33:37.940
Do you all

700
33:38.030 --> 33:39.040
go out at night?

701
33:39.070 --> 33:40.740
We usually stay inside at night.

702
33:40.740 --> 33:41.810
- We stay in. - Why?

703
33:43.070 --> 33:44.370
There's nothing to do at night.

704
33:44.370 --> 33:45.810
So we head home early.

705
33:45.810 --> 33:46.420
That's right.

706
33:47.880 --> 33:49.140
We just wash up and go to bed.

707
33:49.510 --> 33:49.860
Exactly.

708
33:50.960 --> 33:51.490
Honey.

709
33:52.680 --> 33:54.050
Why are you sitting here all alone?

710
33:55.790 --> 33:57.180
Is something bothering you?

711
33:58.590 --> 33:59.140
No.

712
34:02.160 --> 34:03.530
Does anything strange happen at night?

713
34:03.550 --> 34:04.700
Your cousin and her husband

714
34:04.880 --> 34:06.770
have been asking everyone about the rabbit demon today.

715
34:07.160 --> 34:07.860
Honey, do you know

716
34:07.880 --> 34:09.170
what's gotten into them?

717
34:10.030 --> 34:10.740
Why are they suddenly

718
34:10.800 --> 34:12.210
so interested in these strange stories?

719
34:12.880 --> 34:14.570
When did the rabbit demon first appear?

720
34:15.960 --> 34:17.380
Why are you asking about it too?

721
34:20.800 --> 34:21.940
It's been quite a few years now.

722
34:22.800 --> 34:23.980
I can't quite remember.

723
34:28.440 --> 34:29.940
Then when did I leave?

724
34:30.510 --> 34:31.460
And why?

725
34:32.110 --> 34:33.610
You said you had something to find.

726
34:34.440 --> 34:35.820
When you left,

727
34:36.360 --> 34:38.740
I think that's when the rabbit demon started causing trouble.

728
34:39.670 --> 34:40.460
So that means

729
34:40.480 --> 34:41.490
I've been gone for years.

730
34:44.000 --> 34:45.740
What was I looking for?

731
34:52.480 --> 34:53.570
Why are you asking all this?

732
34:53.920 --> 34:54.650
I'm the one who wants to know

733
34:55.150 --> 34:55.980
what really happened to you

734
34:56.000 --> 34:57.010
when you went into the mountains this time.

735
34:58.030 --> 34:59.010
Ever since you came back,

736
34:59.070 --> 35:00.490
everyone says you're a different man.

737
35:00.760 --> 35:01.900
And I feel the same way.

738
35:02.070 --> 35:03.460
If you think I'm so strange,

739
35:03.800 --> 35:05.130
then stop treating me like your husband.

740
35:05.670 --> 35:06.460
Honey, where are you going?

741
35:07.400 --> 35:07.820
Miss?

742
35:07.960 --> 35:08.940
What's wrong?

743
35:11.960 --> 35:12.460
Honey!

744
35:16.510 --> 35:17.460
What happened to your cousin?

745
35:18.070 --> 35:19.170
She was perfectly fine,

746
35:19.400 --> 35:20.340
then suddenly fainted.

747
35:20.340 --> 35:20.860
Exactly.

748
35:22.480 --> 35:22.940
Cheng Kong.

749
35:24.960 --> 35:26.540
Back at Mount Leiguan,

750
35:26.540 --> 35:28.210
I could tell something was wrong with Yamao.

751
35:28.840 --> 35:30.130
I thought it was just because

752
35:30.150 --> 35:31.090
she was so weak.

753
35:31.550 --> 35:32.460
Didn't you say

754
35:33.110 --> 35:34.130
her vital energy was depleted?

755
35:36.070 --> 35:36.860
My Lord,

756
35:37.480 --> 35:38.490
Yamao

757
35:39.190 --> 35:40.060
can no longer withstand

758
35:40.060 --> 35:41.850
the dark energy you use to water the mystical flower.

759
35:42.110 --> 35:42.940
The Moonlit Revival Herb

760
35:43.110 --> 35:43.820
is pure by nature.

761
35:44.000 --> 35:44.940
But your dark energy

762
35:45.320 --> 35:46.170
is fierce and overwhelming.

763
35:46.550 --> 35:47.690
The two are completely incompatible.

764
35:47.920 --> 35:49.420
You must stop watering the mystical flower.

765
35:49.710 --> 35:50.570
Absolutely not.

766
35:50.960 --> 35:51.900
If you keep this up,

767
35:52.440 --> 35:53.740
you'll end up killing her.

768
35:56.670 --> 35:58.130
You keep saying

769
35:58.150 --> 35:59.420
you're worried about her safety.

770
36:00.550 --> 36:01.650
But didn't you come here

771
36:01.670 --> 36:03.130
for her herb core?

772
36:05.070 --> 36:06.050
Arguing about this now

773
36:06.150 --> 36:06.980
won't help anyone.

774
36:07.230 --> 36:08.610
I'll make some pills to restore her vital energy.

775
36:11.360 --> 36:11.820
We don't need your help.

776
36:12.590 --> 36:13.530
For all we know, what you make

777
36:13.530 --> 36:14.260
could be poison instead of medicine.

778
36:14.590 --> 36:15.860
His Lordship and I will find a way

779
36:15.860 --> 36:16.820
to restore her strength.

780
37:06.320 --> 37:07.010
Are you really

781
37:07.010 --> 37:08.090
my husband's cousin?

782
37:08.800 --> 37:09.960
Why have I never heard him

783
37:09.960 --> 37:10.820
mention you before?

784
37:11.840 --> 37:13.130
And why has he been

785
37:15.030 --> 37:16.300
a different man ever since you showed up?

786
37:31.320 --> 37:31.860
Drink this.

787
37:33.150 --> 37:33.690
Once you finish it,

788
37:34.360 --> 37:36.010
everything will be fine.

789
37:49.400 --> 37:50.300
What are you trying to do?

790
37:53.590 --> 37:54.130
Cheng Kong.

791
37:55.230 --> 37:56.340
What do you think I'm trying to do?

792
37:56.360 --> 37:57.010
Poison her?

793
38:08.360 --> 38:09.340
What I just gave her

794
38:10.070 --> 38:11.810
was the well water you've been

795
38:11.810 --> 38:12.710
so desperate to find.

796
38:13.070 --> 38:14.340
You said yourself it worked wonders.

797
38:16.550 --> 38:17.090
Xiangyuan...

798
38:17.110 --> 38:17.900
Don't call me!

799
38:19.590 --> 38:20.610
I was kind enough to help you save her,

800
38:20.920 --> 38:21.810
but you keep pushing me aside

801
38:21.810 --> 38:22.740
for her sake!

802
38:23.840 --> 38:24.940
I don't want to see either of you.

803
38:36.360 --> 38:37.050
You're awake.

804
38:39.030 --> 38:40.010
What just happened?

805
38:40.190 --> 38:41.690
We figured out why you fainted.

806
38:41.840 --> 38:42.940
Your body can no longer handle

807
38:43.000 --> 38:44.300
the dark energy used to water the mystical flower.

808
38:44.550 --> 38:45.740
If this keeps up,

809
38:46.190 --> 38:46.820
it won't end well.

810
38:51.280 --> 38:52.570
The water Xiangyuan just gave me

811
38:53.320 --> 38:54.900
really did help with my weakness.

812
38:55.800 --> 38:56.460
Could that water

813
38:56.480 --> 38:57.530
neutralize the dark energy?

814
38:58.000 --> 38:58.650
This water

815
38:59.230 --> 39:00.610
comes from the same source as the lake

816
39:01.280 --> 39:02.010
on Mount Qihuang.

817
39:02.320 --> 39:03.860
But those places are so far apart.

818
39:04.360 --> 39:05.650
Something's definitely strange about this place.

819
39:06.030 --> 39:07.300
As for what we found out today,

820
39:07.840 --> 39:09.340
the day Cheng Kong disappeared

821
39:09.800 --> 39:10.380
was the same day the rabbit demon

822
39:10.400 --> 39:11.300
started causing trouble.

823
39:11.840 --> 39:13.610
Every clue points to Cheng Kong.

824
39:14.400 --> 39:15.780
Only by restoring Xiangyuan's memory

825
39:15.960 --> 39:16.490
can we find out

826
39:16.550 --> 39:17.650
what really happened.

827
39:17.670 --> 39:18.980
Easy for you to say!

828
39:19.190 --> 39:20.610
How are we supposed to restore her memory?

829
39:20.800 --> 39:21.650
Besides,

830
39:22.070 --> 39:23.460
His Lordship just had

831
39:23.510 --> 39:24.170
a huge fight with Xiangyuan.

832
39:24.590 --> 39:26.090
She doesn't want to see you right now.

833
39:49.590 --> 39:50.860
Please.

834
39:53.510 --> 39:54.610
Lord Fengyin.

835
39:58.360 --> 40:00.000
Mr. Fengxian.

836
40:01.030 --> 40:02.490
Pretty please.

837
40:02.550 --> 40:05.010
Just go talk to her.

838
40:05.590 --> 40:06.570
If I don't agree,

839
40:07.150 --> 40:08.260
are you going to keep pestering me like this?

840
40:32.580 --> 40:36.620
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

841
40:36.860 --> 40:40.300
♪So many longings♪

842
40:40.980 --> 40:43.060
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

843
40:43.260 --> 40:48.260
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

844
40:49.180 --> 40:53.220
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

845
40:53.460 --> 40:56.900
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

846
40:57.580 --> 40:59.660
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

847
40:59.860 --> 41:07.260
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

848
41:08.660 --> 41:12.340
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

849
41:12.580 --> 41:16.260
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

850
41:16.900 --> 41:20.460
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

851
41:20.780 --> 41:24.940
♪Still waits to come true♪

852
41:25.180 --> 41:28.860
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

853
41:29.420 --> 41:33.060
♪I'll stay by your side♪

854
41:33.540 --> 41:37.140
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

855
41:37.380 --> 41:44.700
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

856
41:58.180 --> 42:02.220
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

857
